window.ACTS_I18N["en"] = {"10 秒，猜他从哪来":"10 seconds: guess where they're from","21 天后打开罐子：你的开心最多来自哪里？":"After 21 days, open the jar: where does most of your happiness come from?","30 天，看它长":"30 days of watching it grow","30 张连起来：它怎么朝着光转，你有多少耐心。":"Put the 30 photos together: how it turns towards the light, and how patient you are.","30 格连起来，就是季节走过你的窗。":"Put the 30 squares together and you'll see the seasons pass your window.","Yuki 的小镇把垃圾分成几十类，几乎不扔东西。":"Yuki's town sorts its rubbish into dozens of types and throws almost nothing away.","一个两边都有道理的热议题。每天听一方的一个理由。":"A hot topic where both sides have a point. Every day, hear one reason from one side.","一个正在发生、有出处的热议话题。每天看一个国家的人怎么说。":"A hot topic happening right now, with sources. Every day, see what people in one country say.","一个正在流行、安全的小挑战。":"A small, safe challenge that's trending right now.","一件事，每个国家的人怎么看":"One story, and how people in each country see it","一张你家东西的旅行地图。":"A travel map of the things in your home.","一张你的衣柜世界地图。":"A world map of your wardrobe.","一本小采访：你是从哪来的。":"A little interview: where you're from.","一桌全世界的年夜饭。":"A New Year's dinner table with the whole world.","一次就好：倒、拍、说。":"Just once: tip it out, snap it, say it.","一顿饭走了多少公里？":"How many kilometres did one meal travel?","一颗豆子、一个杯子、一点水。Theo 每年春天带小学生种。":"One bean, one cup, a little water. Theo plants them with primary-school kids every spring.","两周的「猜的」和「真的」并排，你差了多少？":"Two weeks of \"my guess\" and \"the real number\" side by side — how far off were you?","两边都有道理的事，你站哪边？":"When both sides have a point, which side are you on?","伊斯坦布尔博物馆讲解员":"Museum guide in Istanbul","伦敦·植物园园丁":"London · botanic garden gardener","伦敦的发音老师":"Pronunciation teacher in London","伦敦财经记者":"Finance journalist in London","你一周的晚饭加起来走了多远。":"How far your week of dinners travelled, all added up.","你一天说几次 sorry？英国人呢？":"How many times a day do you say sorry? And the British?","你以为你一天看手机多久？":"How long do you think you spend on your phone a day?","你会怎么用它。":"How you'd use it.","你会用哪一个，用在哪。":"Which one you'd use, and where.","你做一遍，看全世界的版本。":"Do it once, then see everyone else's version.","你出门离不开什么？":"What can't you leave the house without?","你名字的心意，用英语讲给一个陌生人听。":"The meaning behind your name, told in English to a stranger.","你天生是早睡型还是晚睡型？":"Were you born an early bird or a night owl?","你家年夜饭桌上一定有的那道":"The dish that's always on your family's New Year's table","你扔掉最多的是什么？":"What do you throw away most?","你最常注意的东西，就是你在乎的东西。":"What you notice most is what you care about.","你最常注意的是什么？":"What do you notice most?","你最常说的那句，是什么？":"What's the line you say most often?","你的 sorry 有一半其实是「借过」。全世界谁说得最多？":"Half your sorrys are really \"excuse me\". Who in the world says it most?","你的一周垃圾账，和她的小镇比一比。":"Your week of rubbish, next to her town's.","你的作息曲线，和全世界、和你的家人比一比。":"Your sleep curve, compared with the world's and your family's.","你的冬天有多长，Ingrid 那里太阳干脆不升起。":"How long your winter is — where Ingrid lives, the sun doesn't rise at all.","你的口头禅在什么时候出现？英语里它怎么说？":"When does your pet phrase come out? How do you say it in English?","你的名字，别人念对过吗？":"Has anyone ever said your name right?","你的版本，送给世界。":"Your version, sent to the world.","你离不开的三样东西，跟全世界的包比一比。":"The three things you can't go without, next to bags from all over the world.","你站哪边，这周改没改主意。":"Which side you're on, and whether you changed your mind this week.","你身上那件，经过了谁的手？":"The top you're wearing — whose hands has it passed through?","冬至前四周，每天记下你那里几点天黑，跟全世界接力。":"For the four weeks before the winter solstice, note what time it gets dark where you are — a relay with the whole world.","冬至前，黑夜怎么绕着地球走":"Before the winter solstice: how the night travels round the Earth","出门前把包里的东西全倒在桌上，一样样拍下来、说出它的英文名。":"Before you go out, tip everything in your bag onto the table, snap each thing and say its name in English.","同一扇窗，看一个月":"One window, one month","同一首歌，每天听一遍，每天多听懂一句。":"The same song, once a day — and each day you catch one more line.","听、猜、看答案，再跟着说一遍这句。":"Listen, guess, check the answer, then say the line along with it.","听、猜意思、看真实的例子。":"Listen, guess the meaning, see real examples.","听、给这个理由打分。":"Listen, then rate this reason.","听，点出今天新听懂的那句，跟着哼。":"Listen, tap the line you caught for the first time today, and hum along.","在北京教外国人中文":"Teaches Chinese to foreigners in Beijing","在大阪教英语的美国人":"American English teacher in Osaka","墨尔本大学生博主":"Uni student and creator in Melbourne","墨尔本跑步教练":"Running coach in Melbourne","多伦多心理咨询师":"Counsellor in Toronto","大多数人会把自己看手机的时间猜少。14 天里每晚先猜、再看手机记下的真数字；第二周做一个小实验。":"Most people guess too low for their phone time. For 14 days, guess each night, then check the real number your phone records; in week two, try a small experiment.","天黑时拍一张、记时间。":"When it gets dark, take a photo and note the time.","布宜诺斯艾利斯文化记者":"Culture journalist in Buenos Aires","开学这周，定一件这学期想学会的小事，每天做一点。":"In the first week of term, pick one small thing you want to learn this term and do a bit every day.","录下你的名字和它的意思，听全世界的人怎么念。":"Record your name and what it means, and hear how people around the world say it.","我们很容易记住坏事，好事一下就忘了。每天抓住一个小开心，写一句放进罐子。":"We remember the bad stuff easily and forget the good stuff fast. Each day, catch one small happy moment, write one line and drop it in the jar.","拍、说它为什么一定要有。":"Snap it and say why it has to be there.","早上 30 秒：几点睡、几点醒、今天精神怎么样。":"30 seconds each morning: when you slept, when you woke, how much energy you have today.","早睡型和晚睡型是天生的，有名字，叫 chronotype。两周里每天记几点睡、几点起、白天哪个时候最清醒。":"Being an early bird or a night owl is something you're born with, and it has a name: chronotype. For two weeks, note when you go to sleep, when you get up, and when in the day you feel most awake.","春节前后，全世界的人拍自己家团圆饭桌上一定有的那道菜。":"Around Chinese New Year, people everywhere snap the one dish that's always on their family reunion table.","最后一天你站一边，用英语说为什么。":"On the last day you pick a side and say why, in English.","最后一天录你自己的，看全世界把你猜成哪里。":"On the last day, record your own voice and see where the world guesses you're from.","最近冒出来的说法，你会用吗？":"Brand-new expressions — would you use them?","柏林·注意力心理学家":"Berlin · attention psychologist","每个人都有一句不自觉就说的话。问一个朋友，然后一周里抓住自己说它的时刻。":"Everyone has a line they say without noticing. Ask a friend, then spend a week catching yourself saying it.","每天 1 分钟：写一句今天的小开心，点一下它来自哪里。":"1 minute a day: write one line about a small happy moment today, and tap where it came from.","每天 10 秒：同一扇窗拍一张，点一下今天的天气。":"10 seconds a day: one photo from the same window, and a tap for today's weather.","每天一个最近冒出来的英语新说法：什么意思、谁在用、从哪来。":"One brand-new English expression a day: what it means, who uses it, where it came from.","每天同一个时间，拍一张窗外。光线变了、天黑得越来越早、雨来了又走。":"Same time every day, one photo out of the window. The light changes, it gets dark earlier and earlier, rain comes and goes.","每天多听懂一句":"One more line every day","每天往前翻一周，点一下这一周拍得最多的那类。":"Each day, go back one week and tap the kind of photo you took most that week.","每天找家里一样东西，查它最早从哪来。":"Each day, find one thing at home and look up where it first came from.","每天拍它一张。":"One photo of it every day.","每天翻 3 件，记国家。":"Check 3 pieces of clothing a day and note the country.","每天记一句今天做了什么。":"Each day, one line about what you did today.","每天记下晚饭里走得最远的一样。":"Each day, note the thing in your dinner that travelled furthest.","每天问长辈一个问题：20 岁挣多少、一碗面多少钱、第一份工作、怎么认识的、最难的一年。":"Ask an older person one question a day: what they earned at 20, what a bowl of noodles cost, their first job, how they met, their hardest year.","每晚 1 分钟：先猜，再看「屏幕使用时间」，点一下用得最多的 app。":"1 minute each night: guess first, then check Screen Time and tap the app you used most.","每晚看一眼垃圾桶，点一下最多的是哪类。":"Each night, glance in the bin and tap which kind there's most of.","每说一次 sorry，点一下，选是哪种：道歉、借过、没听清、客气。":"Every time you say sorry, tap and pick which kind: apologising, getting past, didn't catch it, being polite.","特罗姆瑟·气象员":"Tromsø · meteorologist","看它的一站，猜下一站。":"Look at one stop, guess the next.","看贴纸、看袋子，每样东西都写着一个国家。Bram 在鹿特丹港看着一船船香蕉靠岸。":"Check the stickers and bags — every item has a country on it. In the port of Rotterdam, Bram watches shipload after shipload of bananas come in.","第一天录名字，第二天听别人念、选念得最像的，第三天说名字的故事。":"Day one, record your name; day two, hear others say it and pick the closest; day three, tell the story of your name.","第七天跟着唱完整首，录下来送给世界。":"On day seven, sing the whole song along, record it and send it to the world.","第五天：说给全世界，学期末再来看。":"Day five: tell the world, then come back and look at the end of term.","翻开手机相册，看看你拍得最多的是什么：吃的、猫、天空，还是人？":"Open your photo gallery: what do you take the most pictures of — food, cats, the sky or people?","翻开衣服里的小标签。Rina 每天在达卡检查上千件出口的衣服，她告诉你一件 T 恤怎么走到你的衣柜。":"Check the little label inside your clothes. Every day in Dhaka, Rina inspects thousands of garments for export, and she'll tell you how a T-shirt makes it to your wardrobe.","英语有几百种口音。每天听一段 10 秒的真人录音，猜说话的人来自哪里。":"English has hundreds of accents. Each day, hear a 10-second recording of a real person and guess where they're from.","英语里 sorry 不只是道歉：挤过人群、没听清、想插话都说。这一周数一数你说了几次、在什么时候说。":"In English, sorry isn't only an apology: people say it squeezing through a crowd, when they didn't catch something, when they want to cut in. This week, count how many times you say it, and when.","茶、咖啡、瓷碗，是从哪条路来的？":"Tea, coffee, porcelain bowls — which road did they come by?","让你开心的事，比你想的小":"What makes you happy is smaller than you think","说了就记一下：当时在干嘛、跟谁。":"When you say it, note what you were doing and who you were with.","读一个国家的看法，选你同不同意。":"Read one country's view and choose whether you agree.","达卡·服装质检工程师":"Dhaka · garment quality inspector","这个梗是从哪来的？":"Where did this meme come from?","这周大家都在做的那件小事":"The little thing everyone's doing this week","这周火的一个梗，从哪个国家、哪个平台出来，到了别的语言里变成什么样。":"One meme going viral this week: which country and platform it came from, and what it turned into in other languages.","这学期你最想学会的一件事":"The one thing you most want to learn this term","迪拜空乘":"Flight attendant in Dubai","郁金香、咖啡、瓷器都在伊斯坦布尔转过手。":"Tulips, coffee and porcelain all changed hands in Istanbul.","问、录下来、记一句他说的话。":"Ask, record it, and note down one line they said.","问一个长辈，听一段你不知道的日子":"Ask an older person and hear about days you never knew","阿克拉的音乐学生":"Music student in Accra","雅典哲学老师":"Philosophy teacher in Athens","零垃圾小镇·回收中心":"Zero-waste town · recycling centre","首尔·睡眠科学家":"Seoul · sleep scientist","马尼拉短视频博主":"Short-video creator in Manila","鹿特丹·港口冷链经理":"Rotterdam · port cold-chain manager"};
